instanceFunctions.updateCollisionAreaStats:
Updates this CollisionArea's (CollisionAreaStats)[CollisionAreaStats.md].

Parameters:
- The new values for each [CollisionAreaStats](CollisionAreaStats.md) in an object. You only have to include the stats you want to modify.

```haxe
// Disables the CollisionArea
myCollisionArea.updateCollisionAreaStats({
    disabled: true
});
```
